## VPSApi

### Place a new VPS order, create the invoice, and queue provisioning
## Place a new VPS order, create the invoice, and queue provisioning
POST https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/vps/order
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

{
 "osDistro": "<string>",
 "slices": "<number>",
 "vpsPlatform": "<string>",
 "controlpanel": "<string>",
 "period": "<number>",
 "location": "<number>",
 "osVersion": "<string>",
 "hostname": "<string>",
 "coupon": "<string>",
 "rootpass": "<string>",
 "comment": "<string>"
}


### Permanently delete a VPS backup file by name (irreversible)
## Permanently delete a VPS backup file by name (irreversible)
DELETE https://my.interserver.net/apiv2/vps/{{id}}/backups?all={{all}}&file={{file}}
Accept: application/json
true
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
sessionid: {{apiKey}}

